@startuml
title Combined View 1 - System Context and Container Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

package "Marketplace Platform" #F8FAFC {
  node "Frontend" #F4F7FB {
    [React Web App] as ReactApp
  }

  node "Backend" #FAFBFC {
    [.NET 10 RESTful API] as Api
  }

  database "PostgreSQL" as DB

  node "Observability" #F4F7FB {
    database "Elasticsearch" as Elasticsearch
    [Kibana] as Kibana
  }
}

ReactApp --> Api : HTTPS + JSON/REST
Api --> DB : persist and query data
Api --> Elasticsearch : structured logs via Serilog
Kibana --> Elasticsearch : query log data views\nand dashboard panels

note right of ReactApp
Desktop browser frontend
Single entry point for users
Role-based UI rendering
end note

note right of Api
Main backend application
Business logic and API endpoints
Internal authentication and authorization
Checkout payment records are simulated internally
end note

@enduml
